<title>CANADA: Montreal Exchange says Bre-X trading continues.</title>
<headline>Montreal Exchange says Bre-X trading continues.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Montreal Exchange said on Tuesday its trading systems have not been affected by heavy trading in Bre-X Minerals Ltd.</p>
<p>&quot;Trading (in Bre-X shares) is continuing,&quot; said John Trempe, a spokesman for the Montreal Exchange.</p>
<p>The Toronto Stock Exchange said on Tuesday it halted Bre-X Minerals Ltd shares due to system problems.</p>
<p>The stock was down 3.155 at 0.075 in turnover of 35.4 million shares when it was halted on the TSE.</p>
<p>The cause of the problems was under investigation, a TSE spokesman said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
